      "section_id": "SEC-7634658E73F564BB",
      "section_path": [
        "4 电气连接",
        "4.6 接线步骤",
        "4.6.8 CT接线"
      ],
      "section_title": "4.6.8 CT接线",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n连接电流检测信号线或进行维护操作前，务必确保电流互感器（CT）一次侧回路下\n电。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        92.693,
        340.226,
        433.865,
        364.679
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-DA2CE71ACA885914",
      "document_id": "DOC-5067B181346D",
      "source_sha256": "985ab7688c0888ec68a5b671d2032bb8efd112a6affc42621bcf8c208b870e8e",
